{"articleNo":"74516","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=74516&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013-2014 타이페이 대표부 초청 장학생 선발요강 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.01.23","hit":"3847","attachments":[{"name":"타이페이.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=74516&attachNo=72005"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013-2014 타이페이 대표부 초청 장학생 선발 요강을 다음과 같이 안내하오니, 관심있는 재학생들의 많은 참여를 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 선발요강 및 지원 관련 내용: 붙임 1 - 붙임 4 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">나. 지원방법: 지원 자격을 갖춘 개인이 타이페이 대표부에 직접 지원 </span></u></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\">